          <article class="group relative min-h-[390px] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-ink text-white"><img class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60 transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366811353-6870744d04b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Professional office"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink via-ink/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7"><div class="mb-5 grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-teal"><i data-lucide="briefcase-business" class="h-6 w-6"></i></div><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl">Work in Canada</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Turn your skills and experience into opportunities across Canada.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-mint" href="#contact">Learn more <span class="ml-2">→</span></a></div></article>
          <article class="group relative min-h-[390px] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-ink text-white"><img class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60 transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511895426328-dc8714191300?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Family together"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink via-ink/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7"><div class="mb-5 grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-teal"><i data-lucide="heart-handshake" class="h-6 w-6"></i></div><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl">Family Sponsorship</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Reunite with the people who matter with thoughtful sponsorship support.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-mint" href="#contact">Learn more <span class="ml-2">→</span></a></div></article>
          <article class="group relative min-h-[390px] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-ink text-white"><img class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-60 transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Canadian landscape"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink via-ink/20 to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-7"><div class="mb-5 grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-teal"><i data-lucide="map-pinned" class="h-6 w-6"></i></div><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl">Permanent Residency</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/75">Explore Express Entry and provincial programs around your profile.</p><a class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-mint" href="#contact">Learn more <span class="ml-2">→</span></a></div></article>
