    <section id="about" class="bg-sand py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="container-page grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="relative"><div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-5 h-32 w-32 rounded-full border border-gold/40"></div><img class="relative h-[560px] w-full rounded-sm object-cover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737711867-e3b97375f902?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Immigration advisory team"><div class="absolute -bottom-6 right-6 max-w-[220px] rounded-sm bg-teal p-6 text-white shadow-xl"><i data-lucide="shield-check" class="h-7 w-7 text-mint"></i><p class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl">Clarity at every step</p></div></div>
        <div><p class="eyebrow">About Northway</p><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-[54px]">A more thoughtful way to move forward.</h2><p class="mt-6 leading-7 text-ink/70">Our team believes that immigration advice should feel clear, personal and achievable. We take time to understand your circumstances, explain every option and build a practical plan around your future.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5"><h3 class="font-bold">Honest guidance</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/65">Transparent recommendations with no false promises.</p></div><div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-5"><h3 class="font-bold">One-on-one support</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/65">A responsive team that knows your case and your goals.</p></div></div><a class="btn-primary mt-9" href="#contact">Meet our team</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process" class="bg-ink py-20 text-white sm:py-28">
      <div class="container-page"><div class="mb-12 text-center"><p class="eyebrow !justify-center !text-mint">How it works</p><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold sm:text-[52px]">Simple steps. Clear direction.</h2></div><div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-white/10 md:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="bg-ink p-8"><p class="font-serif text-5xl text-gold/70">01</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-lg font-bold">Initial consultation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">Tell us about your plans and meet with an experienced consultant.</p></div>
        <div class="bg-ink p-8"><p class="font-serif text-5xl text-gold/70">02</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-lg font-bold">Profile assessment</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">We review your eligibility, documents and most suitable pathways.</p></div>
        <div class="bg-ink p-8"><p class="font-serif text-5xl text-gold/70">03</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-lg font-bold">Application strategy</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">Receive a clear plan and begin preparing a strong application.</p></div>
        <div class="bg-ink p-8"><p class="font-serif text-5xl text-gold/70">04</p><h3 class="mt-7 text-lg font-bold">Submission &amp; follow-up</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">We submit, track and keep you informed through the final result.</p></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section id="testimonials" class="bg-sand py-20 sm:py-28">
