          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <button id="testimonialPrev" class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white text-ink transition hover:border-teal hover:text-teal" aria-label="Previous testimonial"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="h-5 w-5"></i></button>
            <button id="testimonialNext" class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-full bg-teal text-white transition hover:bg-ink" aria-label="Next testimonial"><i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="h-5 w-5"></i></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="testimonialCarousel" class="flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-5 overflow-x-auto pb-4 scroll-smooth [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">
          <article class="testimonial-card snap-start rounded-sm bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(11,31,51,.06)] sm:p-9">
            <i data-lucide="quote" class="h-8 w-8 text-gold"></i>
            <p class="mt-6 min-h-[150px] font-serif text-2xl leading-snug">“Northway turned a complicated process into a clear plan. Every question was answered and we always knew what came next.”</p>
