    <section id="faq" class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="container-page grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Frequently asked</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-[54px]">Answers before you begin.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-7 text-ink/65">Every immigration journey is different. Here are answers to some common questions.</p>
          <a class="btn-primary mt-8" href="#contact">Ask your question</a>
        </div>
        <div class="divide-y divide-ink/10 border-y border-ink/10">
          <details class="group py-6" open>
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold">How do I know which immigration program is right for me?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 text-teal transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-4 pr-8 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">We review your goals, education, work experience, language profile and family situation before recommending suitable Canadian immigration pathways.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-6">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold">Do you guarantee application approval?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 text-teal transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-4 pr-8 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">No responsible consultant can guarantee a decision. Government authorities make final decisions, while we help prepare and present a complete, accurate application.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-6">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold">Can you help with study or work permits?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 text-teal transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-4 pr-8 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">Yes. We provide guidance for study permits, work permits, visitor applications, family sponsorship and permanent residence options.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-6">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold">What happens during the first consultation?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 text-teal transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-4 pr-8 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">We discuss your objectives, review your basic profile and explain possible next steps, timelines and documents that may be required.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group py-6">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between font-bold">How can I start my assessment?<i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-5 w-5 text-teal transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-4 pr-8 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/65">Complete the enquiry form below or contact our team directly. We will follow up to arrange a consultation.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="bg-sand py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="container-page grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Talk to an advisor</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-[54px]">Let’s plan your next move.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 max-w-md leading-7 text-ink/65">Tell us a little about your goals. A member of our team will review your enquiry and contact you.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm"><a class="flex items-center gap-3 font-bold" href="tel:+16045550148"><span class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-mint text-teal"><i data-lucide="phone" class="h-4 w-4"></i></span>+1 604 555 0148</a><a class="flex items-center gap-3 font-bold" href="mailto:hello@northwayimmigration.ca"><span class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-mint text-teal"><i data-lucide="mail" class="h-4 w-4"></i></span>hello@northwayimmigration.ca</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-sm bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(11,31,51,.08)] sm:p-9">
          {{ if .enquiry_success }}<div class="mb-6 rounded-sm border border-teal/20 bg-mint px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-teal">{{ .enquiry_success }}</div>{{ end }}
          {{ if .enquiry_error }}<div class="mb-6 rounded-sm border border-red-200 bg-red-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-red-700">{{ .enquiry_error }}</div>{{ end }}
          <form method="POST" action="/contact/enquiries" class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div><label class="mb-2 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Full name *</label><input name="name" required autocomplete="name" class="h-12 w-full rounded-sm border border-ink/15 px-4 outline-none transition focus:border-teal"></div>
            <div><label class="mb-2 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Email address *</label><input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" class="h-12 w-full rounded-sm border border-ink/15 px-4 outline-none transition focus:border-teal"></div>
            <div><label class="mb-2 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Phone number *</label><input name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" class="h-12 w-full rounded-sm border border-ink/15 px-4 outline-none transition focus:border-teal"></div>
            <div><label class="mb-2 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Service interested in</label><select name="service" class="h-12 w-full rounded-sm border border-ink/15 bg-white px-4 outline-none transition focus:border-teal"><option value="Study Permit">Study Permit</option><option value="Work Permit">Work Permit</option><option value="Permanent Residence">Permanent Residence</option><option value="Family Sponsorship">Family Sponsorship</option><option value="Visitor Visa">Visitor Visa</option></select></div>
            <div class="sm:col-span-2"><label class="mb-2 block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">How can we help? *</label><textarea name="message" required rows="5" class="w-full resize-y rounded-sm border border-ink/15 px-4 py-3 outline-none transition focus:border-teal"></textarea></div>
            <div class="sm:col-span-2"><button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">Submit enquiry <i data-lucide="send" class="ml-2 h-4 w-4"></i></button></div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
